# ContextSuite

## AI for Advanced eCommerce 

ContextSuite is the AI-powered commerce platform tailored for mid-market and enterprise retailers. Our modular system seamlessly integrates dynamic pricing, AI sales agents, real-time analytics, and automated support, delivering unparalleled efficiency and personalized customer experiences.

Explore this documentation to quickly understand how ContextSuite's connected intelligence streamlines your e-commerce operations, maximizes profitability, and enhances customer satisfaction.

## Quick Start

Get started with ContextSuite by exploring our comprehensive documentation:

- **[Semantic Events](/docs/semantic-events)** - Learn about our event tracking system
- **[Entities](/docs/entities)** - Understand how we model business entities  
- **[Datapoints](/docs/datapoints)** - Discover granular data collection
- **[Event Bible](/docs/semantic-events/bible)** - Reference for all supported events

## Key Features

{% callout type="note" %}
ContextSuite provides a complete semantic event framework for modern e-commerce analytics.
{% /callout %}

### 🎯 **Semantic Events**
Capture rich, contextual business events that go beyond simple page views and clicks.

### 🏢 **Entity Management** 
Model complex business relationships between users, products, orders, and more.

### 📊 **Real-time Analytics**
Get instant insights from your data with our built-in analytics platform.

### 🤖 **AI-Powered Insights**
Leverage machine learning for automated classification, sentiment analysis, and predictions.

## Getting Started

{% tabs %}
  {% tab label="Quick Setup" %}
  ```bash
  # Install the CXS Analytics client
  npm install @smartdataHQ/cxs-analytics
  
  # Initialize in your app
  import { cxsAnalytics } from '@smartdataHQ/cxs-analytics';
  
  cxsAnalytics({
    host: 'https://inbox.contextsuite.com',
    writeKey: 'YOUR_WRITE_KEY'
  });
  ```
  {% /tab %}
  {% tab label="Send First Event" %}
  ```javascript
  // Track your first semantic event
  cxs.track('Hello World Sent', {
    content: {
      message: 'This is my first semantic event!'
    }
  });
  ```
  {% /tab %}
  {% tab label="Verify Setup" %}
  1. Visit your Context Suite Events Dashboard
  2. Check the Event Explorer
  3. Look for your "Hello World Sent" event
  4. Verify the event properties are captured correctly
  {% /tab %}
{% /tabs %}

